        {
          "id": 1722258136,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It's currently out of sync with the generator script due to fd64746f44 and 7ea5bbb53b. In theory we could just make some simple changes to `wireshark_gen.py` to get things back in sync, but regenerating the dissector here using omniidl 1.0 on Ubuntu 22.04 results in a massive number of changes:\n\n```\n$ git diff --stat\n epan/dissectors/packet-parlay.c | 134172 +++++++++++++++++++------------------\n```\n\nIf it's a candidate for deprecation or removal, maybe we should fix the recursion issue directly and make it a plugin which isn't built by default?",
